      "observed": "The FCC crystal is connected to FCC1 PE6/PE7 rather than its PH0/PH1 oscillator pins; those PH pins instead connect to a capacitor and the VREF+ network. The NAVC crystal nets do not connect to NAVC1, while NAVC1 PH0/PH1 connect to capacitors to ground.",
