          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"31\") (name \"HSE_IN_FCC\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"HSE_OUT_FCC\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"90\") (name \"Net-(NAVC1-PH0)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C37\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"32\") (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C52\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has the specified 25 MHz crystal correctly connected to its HSE pins, so the intended external clock source will not operate.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist shows multiple functional wiring faults: both MCUs lack VDD connections, FCC VCAP pins are repurposed as UART3 signals, and neither HSE crystal is correctly connected to its MCU. These deviations would prevent normal operation of the flight-control system."
}

